Pentaceratops derives its target, transit-model, prior, stellar-relation and
scenario machinery from TRICERATOPS by Steven Giacalone and subsequent local
Pentaceratops research developments. The upstream MIT notice is preserved in
LICENSE. Persistent sampling implements work by Minas Karamanis and Uros Seljak;
FGP methods derive from the related research workflow by Jakob Robnik and
collaborators. Scientific citations are listed in the associated manuscript.

The companions subpackage contains the locally vendored stecomp implementation
and its input tables. Those tables and their original scientific sources must
receive an attribution/licensing review before a public distribution release.
This development package is not an assertion that such a release review is complete.

docs/source_manifest.json records the local files imported during extraction.
No original TRICERATOPS snapshot, archived experiment or prior result is replaced.
